1
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:06,400
Armin, I'm glad I could
be a good person for you.

2
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:09,900
You've won your bet.

3
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:15,620
But this is where my gamble begins!

4
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:36,150
We've identified the person likely
to be the female-form Titan.

5
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,810
Her name is...

6
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:40,650
Annie!

7
00:00:50,730 --> 00:00:52,010
O, my friend!

8
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:54,610
This is a victory for us!

9
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:57,770
Our fame starts here!

10
00:00:57,810 --> 00:00:58,770
O, my friend!

11
00:00:58,770 --> 00:01:04,070
Let us celebrate this victory
for the next battle!

12
00:01:18,710 --> 00:01:24,250
"I died for naught" — I won't
let it end like that for you

13
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:29,510
until I am the last one standing

14
00:01:29,510 --> 00:01:32,490
The enemy is cruel... We will kill...

15
00:01:32,490 --> 00:01:35,530
The enemy is colossal... We will jump...

16
00:01:35,530 --> 00:01:39,170
In our hands we hold blades of glory

17
00:01:39,170 --> 00:01:41,450
and sing in the name of victory

18
00:01:41,450 --> 00:01:46,090
We bear the wings of freedom on our backs

19
00:01:47,410 --> 00:01:53,530
Swearing iron determination upon our hearts,

20
00:01:53,550 --> 00:01:58,070
we slash apart the circle of idiocy

21
00:01:59,650 --> 00:02:01,970
and soar through the sky

22
00:02:02,030 --> 00:02:06,230
with our wings of freedom

23
00:02:20,090 --> 00:02:25,140
Mercy: Assault on Stohess, Part 2

24
00:02:26,830 --> 00:02:29,140
A few days earlier

25
00:02:30,410 --> 00:02:32,040
They're late.

26
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:35,650
Erwin and his damn folk are making me wait.

27
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:40,100
Our Military Police escorts
are gonna arrive first.

28
00:02:41,790 --> 00:02:46,600
Maybe he's constipated again.

29
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:52,990
You're quite talkative today, Captain.

30
00:02:52,990 --> 00:02:54,150
Cut me some slack.

31
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:56,920
Talkativeness is in my personality.

32
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,790
I'm sorry.

33
00:03:07,790 --> 00:03:12,920
It was all my fault. If only
I'd made the right decision...

34
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:18,600
I told you. No one could
have foreseen the outcome.

35
00:03:21,620 --> 00:03:23,370
Sorry for being late.

36
00:03:23,370 --> 00:03:24,510
Not at all.

37
00:03:25,710 --> 00:03:26,940
You guys...

38
00:03:28,550 --> 00:03:30,410
Excuse me...

39
00:03:30,410 --> 00:03:33,310
We've identified the person likely
to be the female-form Titan.

40
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,940
This time we will catch her.

41
00:03:41,590 --> 00:03:43,950
The operation will begin
the day after tomorrow.

42
00:03:43,950 --> 00:03:49,040
The location is Stohess, where we'll be
passing en route to the royal court.

43
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:51,980
This is our one and only chance.

44
00:03:52,330 --> 00:03:56,350
If we can't escape there, you'll inevitably
fall into the hands of the authorities.

45
00:03:56,350 --> 00:03:59,840
Then it'll be even harder to pursue
those who scheme to destroy the Walls.

46
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:04,620
Mankind's annihilation will
become even more imminent.

47
00:04:05,310 --> 00:04:07,760
We must bet everything we
have on this operation.

48
00:04:09,270 --> 00:04:11,020
The plan is at follows:

49
00:04:11,930 --> 00:04:13,840
While we're passing through Stohess,

50
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:17,770
Eren, you'll act as bait to
lure the target to this tunnel.

51
00:04:18,100 --> 00:04:20,050
If you can bring her into its depths,

52
00:04:20,050 --> 00:04:26,090
then even if she transforms, she won't
have the space to utilize her power.

53
00:04:26,660 --> 00:04:29,830
But if by any chance she
transforms before then,

54
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:32,380
we'll have to rely on you, Eren.

55
00:04:32,940 --> 00:04:38,540
Yes, sir. Are we certain
our target is in Stohess?

56
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:41,760
Yes. She's in the Police.

57
00:04:42,110 --> 00:04:43,680
The Police?

58
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,480
Armin figured it all out.

59
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:51,310
She's also suspected of killing
those two captive Titans.

60
00:04:52,210 --> 00:04:56,230
She might be your former
fellow cadet from the 104th.

61
00:04:57,310 --> 00:05:01,400
Hold on now! The 104th?!

62
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:05,730
The name of the woman suspected
to be the female-form is...

63
00:05:05,730 --> 00:05:07,290
Wait...

64
00:05:13,390 --> 00:05:16,310
Annie Leonhardt.

65
00:05:27,930 --> 00:05:28,840
Shit!

66
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:41,360
Damn! The way she was acting... She
must've seen through me right away!

67
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:44,030
She knew we were gonna ambush her underground!

68
00:05:44,030 --> 00:05:47,030
There must've been some other way!

69
00:05:47,420 --> 00:05:49,780
You'll have time to think about that later.

70
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:52,170
What should we do now?

71
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:57,280
First of all, we need to rendezvous
with Team 3 on the surface

72
00:05:57,280 --> 00:06:01,790
then according to the backup plan,
fight Annie... the female-form Titan.

73
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:06,960
Eren, you'll have to transform
and assist with her capture.

74
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,310
That okay?

75
00:06:08,310 --> 00:06:09,180
Yeah.

76
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,080
Hey!

77
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,060
It's Team 3!

78
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:15,560
Did your capture attempt fail?

79
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:17,430
It did!

80
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:19,940
Move on to the next sta...

81
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,810
She kicked it in?!

82
00:06:34,630 --> 00:06:35,700
We have to help them!

83
00:06:35,700 --> 00:06:37,580
Eren! Back!

84
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:40,250
Hey, Mikasa!

85
00:06:41,100 --> 00:06:44,690
That bitch wouldn't mind killing Eren?

86
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,350
She risked it...

87
00:06:47,890 --> 00:06:51,410
She smashed open the tunnel
hoping she wouldn't kill you.

88
00:06:51,410 --> 00:06:53,600
It's crazy, but that just
makes her even scarier!

89
00:06:55,930 --> 00:06:59,600
Annie will be trying as hard
as she can to catch you!

90
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:07,530
What should we do? She cut off our escape.

91
00:07:07,530 --> 00:07:09,800
Even if we jumped out using our gear,

92
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:11,490
she'd ambush us the instant we surfaced.

93
00:07:11,690 --> 00:07:12,900
On the other hand,

94
00:07:17,110 --> 00:07:21,030
if we stay here it's just a matter
of time until we're crushed.

95
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,940
I'll handle this!

96
00:07:23,940 --> 00:07:26,460
Like that time with the cannonball!

97
00:07:29,130 --> 00:07:30,360
Come here!

98
00:07:31,100 --> 00:07:32,270
Let's do this!

99
00:07:32,270 --> 00:07:33,550
Stay close to me!

100
00:07:44,940 --> 00:07:48,400
Not again! Why now?!

101
00:07:53,340 --> 00:07:55,660
Why now?! It hurts!

102
00:07:57,960 --> 00:08:02,260
So you can't transform unless it's
for a specific, concrete reason?

103
00:08:02,260 --> 00:08:04,420
Clear your mind! Focus on it again!

104
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:07,170
I'm trying!

105
00:08:14,250 --> 00:08:15,140
Aren't you really

106
00:08:16,900 --> 00:08:20,850
just hesitating to fight Annie?

107
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,650
Eren?

108
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:28,400
Don't tell me that you still

109
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:32,110
refuse to accept that she's the female-form?

110
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:37,730
What just happened right before your eyes?

111
00:08:37,730 --> 00:08:42,360
That bitch killed your comrades!
You still refuse to accept that?

112
00:08:44,870 --> 00:08:48,340
Shut up! You're not helping!

113
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:53,630
Annie's the female-form Titan?

114
00:08:54,250 --> 00:08:58,150
Why? Why would you say that, Armin?

115
00:08:59,020 --> 00:09:02,770
She knew your face from the beginning.

116
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:06,650
Not to mention, she reacted when I referred
to how you "sought to die so soon,"

117
00:09:06,970 --> 00:09:09,570
which nobody outside the
104th would understand.

118
00:09:09,940 --> 00:09:14,160
And mostly because I'm pretty
sure she killed Sawney and Bean,

119
00:09:14,180 --> 00:09:16,260
the two experimental subjects.

120
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:20,200
But why?

121
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:24,240
One would need quite the
skill to kill those two.

122
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:26,360
The culprit would've used
their own 3D Maneuver Gear,

123
00:09:26,380 --> 00:09:27,720
since they'd be
accustomed to it.

124
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:33,380
So that's why we had a gear check?
But Annie wasn't caught.

125
00:09:33,380 --> 00:09:36,590
Because she brought Marco's to the check.

126
00:09:37,450 --> 00:09:40,180
That's how she passed.

127
00:09:42,650 --> 00:09:47,020
What? What does Marco have to do with this?

128
00:09:47,820 --> 00:09:49,270
I don't know.

129
00:09:49,900 --> 00:09:51,560
Are you sure you're not mistaken?

130
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:54,000
No, I'm pretty certain.

131
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:58,780
I got that, kid. Do you
have any other evidence?

132
00:09:59,030 --> 00:10:00,770
I don't.

133
00:10:00,770 --> 00:10:04,370
In my opinion, the
female-form resembles Annie.

134
00:10:04,370 --> 00:10:06,290
What? What are you even saying?!

135
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,190
Is that all you...

136
00:10:08,190 --> 00:10:10,630
So we've got no proof, but we'll still do it.

137
00:10:11,190 --> 00:10:13,220
No proof?

138
00:10:13,220 --> 00:10:15,980
What? Then why?

139
00:10:15,980 --> 00:10:18,070
What if it isn't Annie?

140
00:10:18,070 --> 00:10:21,490
If it's not Annie, then she'll
be cleared of suspicion.

141
00:10:22,170 --> 00:10:25,240
True, we'll have put her
through a terrible ordeal.

142
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:31,520
But if we do nothing, you'll be
sacrificed to Central's whims.

143
00:10:32,210 --> 00:10:34,940
It's just not right to doubt Annie..

144
00:10:34,940 --> 00:10:39,280
Eren, after hearing that it might be
Annie, has anything come to mind?

145
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:51,250
You fought the female-form
in hand-to-hand combat.

146
00:10:51,510 --> 00:10:54,910
Did she use any of Annie's typical moves?

147
00:11:12,860 --> 00:11:20,770
You know it too. Annie is
the female-form Titan.

148
00:11:24,630 --> 00:11:27,810
So why aren't you fighting?

149
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:33,920
Are other feelings holding you back?

150
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:35,340
What?!

151
00:11:40,100 --> 00:11:41,630
I've got a plan!

152
00:11:42,850 --> 00:11:46,890
Mikasa and I will exit that hole
and the entrance at the same time.

153
00:11:47,090 --> 00:11:49,640
Annie will have to follow one of us.

154
00:11:50,020 --> 00:11:53,150
That should buy you time to run the other way!

155
00:11:53,460 --> 00:11:55,070
Wait!

156
00:11:55,070 --> 00:11:57,800
That means one of you is going to die!

157
00:11:57,800 --> 00:11:59,940
If we keep sitting here,
it'll be all three of us!

158
00:12:00,700 --> 00:12:02,640
Mikasa! On my mark!

159
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:03,420
Okay!

160
00:12:03,420 --> 00:12:04,820
I'll go that way!

161
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:08,020
Mikasa!

162
00:12:08,020 --> 00:12:09,040
Armin!

163
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,330
How?

164
00:12:11,690 --> 00:12:14,440
How can you fight?!

165
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:16,040
How?!

166
00:12:20,350 --> 00:12:21,920
We've got no choice.

167
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:25,290
It's a cruel world out there.

168
00:12:58,680 --> 00:12:59,950
Eren!

169
00:13:15,670 --> 00:13:19,400
Annie! I'm not letting you have Eren!

170
00:13:20,660 --> 00:13:21,860
Eren!

171
00:13:23,170 --> 00:13:25,970
Eren! I'm going for you!

172
00:13:29,570 --> 00:13:31,350
Eren! Wake up!

173
00:13:56,010 --> 00:13:58,140
Don't let the female-form get away!

174
00:13:58,140 --> 00:14:01,230
We can't let her out of here!

175
00:14:06,820 --> 00:14:08,320
What's going on?!

176
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:12,130
Backup team! Leave this to us!
Go check it out!

177
00:14:12,130 --> 00:14:13,450
Yes, sir!

178
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:16,810
This is weird.

179
00:14:16,810 --> 00:14:19,500
That explosion and...

180
00:14:19,500 --> 00:14:20,490
Nile!

181
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:23,340
Dispatch all of your soldiers.

182
00:14:23,340 --> 00:14:25,870
It's probably a Titan.

183
00:14:25,870 --> 00:14:27,300
What are you saying?

184
00:14:27,300 --> 00:14:32,270
This is Wall Sina! There can't
possibly be Titans in here!

185
00:14:33,130 --> 00:14:35,020
Stop! Don't move, Jaeger!

186
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:37,680
I've tired of playing dress-up!

187
00:14:38,900 --> 00:14:42,190
Never call me that again, asshole!

188
00:14:42,550 --> 00:14:44,990
Commander, I'll go as well.

189
00:14:44,990 --> 00:14:47,110
Get your gear from Team 4.

190
00:14:47,110 --> 00:14:48,110
Yes, sir.

191
00:14:48,110 --> 00:14:52,380
Having a fiery spirit is good, but
don't forget how to stay alive.

192
00:14:52,380 --> 00:14:53,160
Yes, sir.

193
00:14:55,940 --> 00:14:58,200
Erwin, what...

194
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,920
Commander, here!

195
00:15:01,630 --> 00:15:02,960
Thank you.

196
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:07,050
Hey, Erwin...

197
00:15:07,990 --> 00:15:10,480
All that can move, mobilize!

198
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:12,650
We must assist with the
capture of the female-form!

199
00:15:14,020 --> 00:15:16,010
Erwin, stop!

200
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:22,980
What you're doing is a clear
rebellion against the King!

201
00:15:23,500 --> 00:15:24,850
No.

202
00:15:24,850 --> 00:15:28,320
Is your head as hollow as that gun barrel?

203
00:15:28,890 --> 00:15:31,820
You haven't a clue what's
going on, by the looks of it.

204
00:15:31,820 --> 00:15:34,370
Dismantle your gear, Erwin!

205
00:15:36,670 --> 00:15:38,450
A Titan! There's a Titan!

206
00:15:38,450 --> 00:15:40,870
How did it get here?!

207
00:15:41,800 --> 00:15:44,660
Dude... That's a Titan.

208
00:15:44,660 --> 00:15:46,210
But how?

209
00:15:46,210 --> 00:15:47,500
Outta my way!

210
00:15:49,580 --> 00:15:52,260
Just stay standing, dammit!

211
00:15:52,710 --> 00:15:56,260
I wanted to be one of them.

212
00:15:56,260 --> 00:15:59,100
What about now?

213
00:15:59,100 --> 00:16:00,230
Shit!

214
00:16:01,890 --> 00:16:03,730
Don't even try taking it down!

215
00:16:03,730 --> 00:16:05,610
It'll be enough if we can just hold it back!

216
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:20,540
It's hopeless! It can see right through
the movements of the 3D Maneuver Gear!

217
00:16:24,420 --> 00:16:27,750
You won't get rid of me so easily!

218
00:16:35,060 --> 00:16:38,390
Eren! Answer me! Eren!

219
00:16:38,390 --> 00:16:40,270
What are you doing?!

220
00:16:40,270 --> 00:16:42,310
Jean! Eren's under here!

221
00:16:42,310 --> 00:16:45,310
What?! Wasn't he supposed
to transform into a Titan?

222
00:16:45,710 --> 00:16:47,310
He couldn't!

223
00:16:47,310 --> 00:16:51,440
Probably because the female-form
was actually Annie.

224
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:52,190
What?!

225
00:16:52,820 --> 00:16:54,990
We have to get him out!

226
00:16:54,990 --> 00:16:57,240
Help, Jean!

227
00:16:57,910 --> 00:16:59,490
He couldn't?!

228
00:17:01,520 --> 00:17:03,750
What the fuck were you thinking, Eren?!

229
00:17:04,150 --> 00:17:07,250
I told you we'd all be counting on you!

230
00:17:07,250 --> 00:17:14,800
Is this our payback for placing mankind's
future and our very survival in your hands?!

231
00:17:15,550 --> 00:17:18,330
Marco... Marco...

232
00:17:29,510 --> 00:17:30,640
Eren?

233
00:17:31,190 --> 00:17:34,650
Shit! We've gotta bitchslap that skank first!

234
00:17:38,130 --> 00:17:42,480
Eren, remember what you told Jean before?

235
00:17:43,430 --> 00:17:48,770
You can't change anything unless you
can discard part of yourself too.

236
00:17:49,510 --> 00:17:54,240
To surpass monsters, you must be
willing to abandon your humanity.

237
00:17:54,780 --> 00:17:57,550
Annie can do that, I bet.

238
00:17:58,550 --> 00:18:00,840
I don't know what her goal is, though.

239
00:18:02,430 --> 00:18:04,830
But whoever can pull it off, wins!

240
00:18:18,260 --> 00:18:19,360
Annie!

241
00:18:20,300 --> 00:18:22,240
If you don't kill me now,

242
00:18:22,610 --> 00:18:26,080
next time you won't have
time to place your bet!

243
00:18:31,830 --> 00:18:33,210
Armin, this way!

244
00:18:33,210 --> 00:18:34,510
Roger!

245
00:18:44,870 --> 00:18:46,620
Coming... She's coming...

246
00:18:46,620 --> 00:18:50,440
Squad Leader, your eyes
are glowing maniacally.

247
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:27,390
Okay! I didn't think we'd need another
backup plan, but you're just insane.

248
00:19:27,390 --> 00:19:30,570
Commander Erwin is quite the guy.

249
00:19:33,020 --> 00:19:34,340
Now then...

250
00:19:38,560 --> 00:19:41,820
Be a good girl for me, will you?

251
00:19:45,500 --> 00:19:51,380
You can't summon other Titans
to eat you either this time.

252
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:59,600
But don't worry... I'm going
to devour you instead.

253
00:19:59,600 --> 00:20:02,970
I'll make sure to digest every
bit of intel I get from you.

254
00:20:08,500 --> 00:20:09,940
She broke free?!

255
00:20:10,580 --> 00:20:12,770
There weren't enough traps?!

256
00:20:13,500 --> 00:20:15,190
Don't let her escape!

257
00:20:21,730 --> 00:20:28,550
You can't change anything unless you
can discard part of yourself too.

258
00:20:30,010 --> 00:20:31,640
I know.

259
00:20:31,640 --> 00:20:38,540
My friends are out there.
I can't fail them now.

260
00:20:40,050 --> 00:20:40,920
Remember...

261
00:20:54,130 --> 00:20:57,660
I'll annihilate her.

262
00:20:57,660 --> 00:21:00,900
No... I'll kill her!

263
00:21:04,700 --> 00:21:08,910
I don't have time to worry
if it's right or wrong.

264
00:21:08,910 --> 00:21:12,910
You can't hope for a horror
story with a happy ending!

265
00:21:14,040 --> 00:21:15,580
Yeah!

266
00:21:15,580 --> 00:21:16,750
Mikasa!

267
00:21:17,500 --> 00:21:20,120
It's a cruel world out there.

268
00:21:29,430 --> 00:21:31,370
What is it this time?!

269
00:22:07,130 --> 00:22:08,270
Eren!

270
00:22:09,630 --> 00:22:11,050
Eren?

271
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:41,590
If we suppose that I am not me,

272
00:22:41,590 --> 00:22:46,130
Can you say with certainty that you are you?

273
00:22:46,780 --> 00:22:51,660
Will you be able to pick up after yourself

274
00:22:51,660 --> 00:22:56,810
Once your sand-like shell breaks and your heart crumbles?

275
00:22:57,090 --> 00:23:02,020
I could hear someone calling

276
00:23:02,310 --> 00:23:05,920
But now my ears are just ringing

277
00:23:06,240 --> 00:23:11,080
It's as if time has frozen

278
00:23:11,380 --> 00:23:13,990
Now, wake up

279
00:23:13,990 --> 00:23:18,960
I began to walk through a deep dark abyss

280
00:23:19,510 --> 00:23:24,260
As swift as a gale, I escaped for my life

281
00:23:24,670 --> 00:23:28,830
I felt like a living corpse

282
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:33,960
We break out of our walls

283
00:23:34,270 --> 00:23:40,350
To reunite in worlds we've yet to map

284
00:23:53,200 --> 00:23:57,111
"I'll exterminate the Titans from this world, not sparing a single one."

285
00:23:58,088 --> 00:24:03,088
The rage that pushed the young Eren to swear so on that day drives him on.

286
00:24:03,844 --> 00:24:05,066
On a path to destroy everything in the world.

287
00:24:05,066 --> 00:24:06,088
Wall: Assault on Stohess, Part 3
On a path to destroy everything in the world.

288
00:24:06,088 --> 00:24:06,966
Wall: Assault on Stohess, Part 3
